  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies a multi-link connection's association and traffic-mapping state.</summary>
    <remarks>These codes describe <see cref="P:Android.Net.Wifi.MloLink.State" />. An idle link is associated without a mapped traffic stream; an active link has at least one mapped traffic stream.</remarks>
